  "published": "2025-12-15T12:29:21.467Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.0.1 - Initial Release\nDate: 15-12-2025\n\nFeatures : \n- Unified storage interface for Azure Blob Storage and AWS S3\n- Complete CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)\n- Support for multiple content formats: string, bytes, stream, file stream\n- Metadata management and file existence checks\n- Copy operations within and across containers/buckets\n- List files with optional prefix filtering\n- Built-in structured logging with correlation IDs\n- Comprehensive error handling with detailed error codes",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "ND Application Framework File Storage Provider",
